-- Ekwo OS — Bhutan: chart of accounts, journals, taxes and defaults.
--
-- Generated from packs/bt at version 0.2.0, do not edit.
-- Change the pack and run `ekwo pack build bt`; `ekwo pack check --all`
-- refuses a seed that is not the exact output of its pack, and the CI runs it.
--
-- Community pack — not reviewed.
-- Written from:
--   Goods and Services Tax Act of Bhutan 2020, consolidated with the amendments of 2021, 2022 and 2025 (the consolidation is not the authoritative text): ss. 2, 12, 14, 16-18, 25-29, 32-38, 42-47, 56-57, 81 and the definitions of 'tax period' and 'tax invoice'; Schedules I, II, IV and V (Department of Revenue and Customs, Ministry of Finance)
--     https://www.drc.gov.bt/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Consolidated-GST-Act-of-Bhutan-2020-and-amendment-thereof.pdf
--   Bhutan — new GST regime to replace the existing sales tax framework: GST Amendment Law 2025 confirms a standard rate of 5 % from 1 January 2026 (KPMG)
--     https://kpmg.com/us/en/taxnewsflash/news/2025/10/tnf-bhutan-new-gst-regime-to-replace-existing-sales-tax-framework.html
--   Notification DRC/TAX/M&E/NOT/2025/1046 of 29 December 2025, Tax Filing for Income Year 2025: income tax returns for the income year 2025 are filed from 1 January 2026, BIT and CIT by 31 March 2026, online on RAMIS (Department of Revenue and Customs, Ministry of Finance)
--     https://www.drc.gov.bt/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Tax-Filing-Notification_IY-2025_final.pdf
--   RAMIS — the Department's taxpayer portal, where tax returns are filed online (Department of Revenue and Customs, Ministry of Finance)
--     https://www.drc.gov.bt/
--   Bhutan — use of IFRS Standards by jurisdiction: the Companies Act of Bhutan 2016 requires Bhutanese Accounting Standards (BAS); IFRS for SMEs adopted in its entirety as BAS for SMEs, required for unlisted companies (IFRS Foundation)
--     https://ifrs.org/use-around-the-world/use-of-ifrs-standards-by-jurisdiction/view-jurisdiction/bhutan
--
-- Reference data: `install_country_template()` copies it into a company,
-- nothing here belongs to a company.

