  ('BT-IFRS-IS', 'BT', 'default', 'Statement of profit or loss', 'income_statement', 'IFRS-SME', date '2014-01-01', null, 'The Companies Act of Bhutan 2016 requires every body corporate to prepare a complete set of financial statements in compliance with the accounting standards the Accounting and Auditing Standards Board of Bhutan prescribes — the Bhutanese Accounting Standards (BAS) — and the IFRS for SMEs Standard is adopted in its entirety as the Bhutan Accounting Standard for SMEs, required for unlisted companies (IFRS Foundation jurisdiction profile). Bhutan has no statutory format for the statements, so these lines are an original presentation by nature of expense that follows IAS 1 / section 4 of IFRS for SMEs (statement of profit or loss).', 'ifrs-profile', null, null, '{}'::jsonb),
